  "title": "Peach Preserves",
  "description": "This peach jam recipe is easy to make with just 3 ingredients so you can enjoy homemade preserves with the flavor of sweet summer peaches all year!",
  "authors": [
    "Kevin"
  ],
  "date_published": "2000-09-16T09:24:13-04:00",
  "date_modified": "2026-03-16T14:03:36-04:00",
  "prep_time": "PT15M",
  "cook_time": "PT35M",
  "total_time": "PT50M",
  "yield": [
    "64",
    "6 (½-pint) jars"
  ],
  "categories": [
    "Jam / Jelly"
  ],
  "cuisines": [
    "American"
  ],
  "regions": [
    "American"
  ],
  "breadcrumbs": [],
  "keywords": [],
  "ingredients": [
    "12 fresh peaches, pitted and chopped",
    "4.5 cups white sugar",
    "1 (2 ounce) package dry pectin"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/0K1iSz7zikDxvMBMkDYFhssESA8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-21351-peach-preserves-step-01-4x3-3a555e720b164bfca8da9699e6a2f8a4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/21351/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Crush 1 cup of chopped peaches in the bottom of a large saucepan. Add remaining peaches and set the pan over medium-low heat.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/fs5uEevAAhBbpcqywVwqF1Rlna0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-21351-peach-preserves-step-02-1-4x3-345c4551018f4ef3b831906b63cffb57.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/21351/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bring to a low boil and cook until peaches become liquid with a few bits of peach left, about 20 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/cqzDDvjIT6lFOl1v5Yq0ImjWw5g=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-21351-peach-preserves-step-03-4x3-32f2d9d8c5f7483a9c1ba1d5db387cb9.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/21351/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour cooked peaches into a bowl, then measure 6 cups of peaches back into the pan (reserving any remaining peaches for another use). Add sugar and bring to a boil over medium heat.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/6D_KdjArHSnqZoUGD4v_x-WE8sE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-21351-peach-preserves-step-05-4x3-4d75b0af79db423ebc72eee021b2746c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/21351/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Gradually stir in dry pectin; boil for 1 minute.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/wvagu-JhkwT8s3yyHzNXWZeDfXs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-21351-peach-preserves-step-06-4x3-6fd5fe7db2294449a6fbf313b8968511.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/21351/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove from heat and pack jam into hot, sterilized jars, filling to within 1/4 inch of the top. Run a clean knife or thin spatula around the insides of the jars to remove any air bubbles. Wipe rims with a moist paper towel to remove any residue.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/CKGzVGiDfhj-_AQqD2Dl95FMauY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-21351-peach-preserves-step-08-4x3-1ced77d6bb034ed5a407002b7f669bda.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/21351/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place a rack in the bottom of a large stockpot and fill halfway with water. Bring to a boil and lower jars 2 inches apart into the boiling water using a holder. Pour in more boiling water to cover jars by at least 1 inch. Bring to a rolling boil, cover, and process for 10 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/7lUUaaZ0v2Z4VtFYRhJz5Ky9Nh8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-21351-peach-preserves-step-09-1-4x3-594845bee10b41fb966544126885eb25.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/21351/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Carefully remove jars from stockpot and let jam cool, then store on a shelf in a cool, dark place. Serve and enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/vcBRg16YLkAI7jPsK7nAB5n4qBA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-21351-peach-preserves-4x3-3436c3d1b0a44f019783f99fc49eb838.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/21351/step_08.webp"
    }
  ],
